-- Lean-only: no Rocq source. A Lean-only helper of `BudgetWitness.lean`.
import {{unit_prefix}}.BudgetWit.Rzb
import {{unit_prefix}}.BudgetWit.RunB
import {{package}}.Reusable.YN3e

/-! The start of `fuzz_knock`'s process over `rzb`: a mirror of `Reusable/YN3e.lean`'s
`src0_start_gen` and `src0_start` (`YN3e.lean:864`, `:1102`), from `init_config` through musl's
`_start_c`/`__libc_start_main` up to the call of `main`.

The statements are R1's with `realizes` written `rzb`; the proofs are R1's with each run taken by
`RunB.rzb_run_gen`/`RunB.rzb_run_to_gen` (twins of `YP03.rz_run_gen`/`rz_run_to_gen`), each
spliced loop by `Rzb.rzb_msteps` (twin of `YK15.rz_msteps`), and the `set_tid_address` ecall by
`RunB.rzb_set_tid_first` (twin of `YP0n.rz_set_tid_first`). Those lemmas build every `rzb` node
of the walk with its `grant_ok`, so no node is built in this file. The public `YN3e` declarations
that do not mention `realizes` (`E_main`, `E_st`, `ss_main`, `main_state`, `runs_main`, the `ews*`
facts, the phase addresses) are `YN3e`'s own, by import.

Mirrored, private as in R1: `yn3e_run_ok_b`, `yn3e_run_ec_b`, `yn3e_runto_ok_b` (R1
`yn3e_run_ok`, `yn3e_run_ec`, `yn3e_runto_ok`). Copied from `YN3e.lean` unchanged, private as in
R1 (a private name is not visible across modules): `yn3e_p64`, `yn3e_p63`, `yn3e_p32`,
`yn3e_p31`; `yn3e_nec`, `yn3e_isec`, `yn3e_addok`, `yn3e_addok_sound`; `yn3e_chkF`, `yn3e_chk_t`,
`yn3e_chk_f`, `yn3e_chk`; `yn3e_opt_mem`, `yn3e_add_chunk_eq`, `yn3e_ss_main`. R1's macro
`yn3e_omega` is copied as `bwst_omega` (a Lean macro is global). The copied `yn3e_chk_t` and
`yn3e_chk_f` evaluate the same closed check as R1's in the kernel once more. -/

